### JSON Handling

- Use standard library `json` module (`json.loads()`, `json.dumps()`)
- Use `pydantic` for runtime validation if needed (optional dependency)
- Keep DTOs simple - use `dataclasses` or `TypedDict`
- Use `@dataclass_json` decorator from `dataclasses-json` if needed

