- Support Python 3.8+ (minimum)
- Test on Python 3.8, 3.9, 3.10, 3.11, 3.12
- Use `python_requires` in `setup.py` or `pyproject.toml`
- Use `typing_extensions` for features not available in older Python versions

### Package Distribution

- Use `setuptools` or `poetry` for package management
- Provide wheels (`.whl`) for faster installation
- Provide source distributions (`.tar.gz`) for compatibility
- Use `pyproject.toml` (PEP 518) for modern Python packaging

### Module Formats

- Use standard Python modules (`.py` files)
- Support both sync and async APIs when appropriate
- Use `__init__.py` files for package initialization
